<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Load Bands — absolute-positioned port of bands_list_LayoutFcn (Mirone
     src_figs/bands_list.m:651). MATLAB's figure is 371x443 with a bottom-left origin, so every
     widget's y here is y_qt = 443 - y_matlab - h and the grouping IS that layout. Do NOT replace
     this with a layout manager. The three QFrames are Mirone's `frame_movel` + its two companions
     (new_frame3D) and are declared FIRST so they stay behind their contents. Captions are widened
     to their own sizeHint at load (Qt's text is wider than MATLAB's) — see BandsListDialog. -->
